WEBVTT

00:13.390 --> 00:14.730
<b>Hey, Child Emperor...</b>

00:16.730 --> 00:17.770
<b>Can I ask you something?</b>

00:18.570 --> 00:20.440
<b>If you're hungry, you'll have to wait.</b>

00:20.740 --> 00:22.070
<b>Not that!</b>

00:22.650 --> 00:23.990
<b>After we escape from here</b>

00:24.070 --> 00:26.700
<b>you'll make sure to take me
to my dad, right?</b>

00:27.080 --> 00:28.540
<b>No, I can't go that far with you.</b>

00:28.990 --> 00:33.250
<b>The other heroes on the surface will
take over to protect you, so don't worry.</b>

00:33.330 --> 00:34.870
<b>The other heroes?</b>

00:35.000 --> 00:36.460
<b>You mean they're not Class-S?</b>

00:36.710 --> 00:38.840
<b>What?! No way!
They gotta be Class-S.</b>

00:38.960 --> 00:40.510
<b>No way.</b>

00:41.510 --> 00:43.090
<b>You saw me fighting, right?</b>

00:43.510 --> 00:44.880
<b>The enemy is strong.</b>

00:44.880 --> 00:47.850
<b>I have to get back to the battlefield
right away and support everyone.</b>

00:49.720 --> 00:51.220
<b>I'm worried about them.</b>

00:52.270 --> 00:55.310
<b>They don't know how to cooperate.</b>

00:56.100 --> 00:58.110
<b>So someone has to
be there to lead them.</b>

01:00.650 --> 01:02.650
<b>You're just a kid
and you're the leader?</b>

01:02.860 --> 01:04.320
<b>But they're all adults.</b>

01:06.450 --> 01:08.530
<b>Honestly, I wish someone else
would take over.</b>

01:08.780 --> 01:09.620
<b>But...</b>

01:11.040 --> 01:13.750
<b>Sorry, this isn't the time
to get into that.</b>

01:14.330 --> 01:17.130
<b>Don't worry.
I'm the class president, too.</b>

01:18.210 --> 01:19.880
<b>Although I don't go to school much.</b>

01:20.750 --> 01:22.670
<b>Look! We're almost at the exit.</b>

01:23.590 --> 01:25.300
<b>Come on, let's go. Waganma.</b>

01:25.680 --> 01:27.550
<b>Oh... Okay.</b>

01:28.470 --> 01:29.510
<b>You're right.</b>

03:00.750 --> 03:03.770
<b>TOP DRAGONS</b>

03:05.690 --> 03:06.860
<b>This is Child Emperor.</b>

03:07.400 --> 03:10.280
<b>I've successfully linked up with
the surface team along with Waganma.</b>

03:10.700 --> 03:12.370
<b>The rescue operation was a success!</b>

03:12.740 --> 03:15.330
<b>I repeat.
The rescue operation was a success!</b>

03:16.040 --> 03:19.000
<b>Child Emperor...
You are seriously incredible.</b>

03:19.250 --> 03:21.580
<b>Yes, your execution was flawless.</b>

03:22.040 --> 03:24.790
<b>You only think that because you didn't see
what happened out there.</b>

03:25.170 --> 03:26.550
<b>We barely made it out alive.</b>

03:27.670 --> 03:29.380
<b>No one's responding.</b>

03:29.760 --> 03:32.090
<b>Hello, is anyone listening?</b>

03:33.720 --> 03:35.930
<b>Are my messages getting through?</b>

03:36.310 --> 03:39.140
<b>Or even if they are,
is anyone actually checking them?</b>

03:39.980 --> 03:42.020
<b>Come on,
can we wrap this up already...</b>

03:43.190 --> 03:49.190
<b>Sekingal, I did explain
how to use the transmitters, right?</b>

03:49.440 --> 03:52.240
<b>Including checking
notifications regularly?</b>

03:52.490 --> 03:56.870
<b>Easy now, they might be
too busy fighting to look.</b>

03:57.200 --> 03:58.370
<b><i>This is Zombieman.</i></b>

03:59.330 --> 04:01.370
<b><i>Good job, Child Emperor.</i></b>

04:01.830 --> 04:02.920
<b>It's Zombieman...</b>

04:03.620 --> 04:04.750
<b><i>This is Amai Mask.</i></b>

04:05.170 --> 04:09.170
<b><i>Got it about the hostage.</i>
<i>The monsters are no big deal.</i></b>

04:09.800 --> 04:12.220
<b><i>I will continue to carry out justice.</i></b>

04:12.590 --> 04:13.930
<b><i>Good job, Child Emperor.</i></b>

04:14.050 --> 04:16.640
<b><i>This is Pig God.</i>
<i>I am currently digesting.</i></b>

04:17.970 --> 04:19.560
<b><i>Hm? What's this?</i></b>

04:19.680 --> 04:21.640
<b><i>So I press here and talk?</i></b>

04:21.930 --> 04:23.190
<b>It's Atomic Samurai!</b>

04:24.940 --> 04:27.520
<b><i>What's this green flashing light?</i></b>

04:27.570 --> 04:29.150
<b>That's my message.</b>

04:29.980 --> 04:33.030
<b><i>Let's see now.</i>
<i>If I press here...</i></b>

04:33.490 --> 04:35.160
<b><i>Oh, the light went off.</i></b>

04:35.320 --> 04:38.330
<b>Oh! He deleted it. Geez.</b>

04:39.740 --> 04:42.120
<b><i>Ahh, this is Atomic Samurai.</i></b>

04:42.160 --> 04:45.960
<b><i>Well, everyone... If you have time,</i>
<i>listen to this message.</i></b>

04:46.500 --> 04:47.960
<b><i>I found a child.</i></b>

04:48.040 --> 04:48.920
<b><i>What?</i></b>

04:49.000 --> 04:51.800
<b><i>The location is...</i>
<i>Hmm, where am I...?</i></b>

04:51.880 --> 04:54.550
<b><i>Well, never mind.</i>
<i>I'll go after him.</i></b>

04:54.630 --> 04:57.680
<b>Hello? This is Child Emperor.
What child?</b>

04:58.430 --> 04:59.810
<b>We lost the connection.</b>

05:01.180 --> 05:02.140
<b>Waganma.</b>

05:03.480 --> 05:04.810
<b>Do you know about this?</b>

05:05.560 --> 05:07.900
<b>So there was another person
held captive?</b>

05:08.480 --> 05:12.030
<b>Um... Well... So...</b>

05:12.360 --> 05:13.490
<b>You knew about it?</b>

05:13.990 --> 05:17.280
<b>Y-Yeah... B-But...
I just wanted to be saved...</b>

05:17.320 --> 05:19.870
<b>I'm s-s-sorry! Sorry!</b>

05:20.120 --> 05:21.080
<b>I have to go.</b>

05:21.740 --> 05:25.500
<b>Sekingal and the surface team.
Please take care of Waganma.</b>

05:25.790 --> 05:28.000
<b>Huh? Don't tell me
you're going back down there?</b>

05:28.210 --> 05:29.130
<b>Child Emperor!</b>

05:29.340 --> 05:32.420
<b>You look exhausted.
Can you still keep going?</b>

05:33.050 --> 05:35.880
<b>Rescuing Waganma was our priority,
and we've accomplished that.</b>

05:36.340 --> 05:37.800
<b>Perhaps it's best to reset...</b>

05:40.970 --> 05:42.850
<b>You don't get it, suit guy.</b>

05:43.140 --> 05:45.850
<b>Now that we know,
we got no choice but to go.</b>

05:46.100 --> 05:47.230
<b>I'll help too.</b>

05:47.600 --> 05:48.940
<b>Let us join you too.</b>

05:49.440 --> 05:50.690
<b>No, that isn't necessary.</b>

05:51.730 --> 05:53.730
<b>Let us each fulfill
our respective roles.</b>

05:54.990 --> 05:55.860
<b><i>Class-S...</i></b>

05:56.360 --> 06:00.450
<b><i>I want to reach that level someday,</i>
<i>but it won't be easy.</i></b>

06:02.160 --> 06:04.000
<b>You came outta nowhere
and tried to cut me.</b>

06:04.450 --> 06:06.500
<b>You trying to pick a fight?</b>

06:06.790 --> 06:11.920
<b>The hard-boiled, yet compassionate hero,
Atomic Samurai, has arrived!</b>

06:12.170 --> 06:14.260
<b>Some arrival...</b>

06:14.670 --> 06:18.470
<b>So you're the Atomic Samurai
Gyoro-Gyoro was talking about.</b>

06:15.170 --> 06:22.150
<b>THREAT LEVEL DRAGON:
BLACK SPERM</b>

06:19.340 --> 06:22.850
<b>You don't look like much,
but whatever.</b>

06:23.180 --> 06:26.310
<b>I've been bored out of my mind.
Entertain me.</b>

06:26.680 --> 06:27.520
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

06:27.640 --> 06:29.730
<b>But I've got no business with you.</b>

06:29.900 --> 06:31.770
<b>You're underestimating me, aren't you?</b>

06:36.860 --> 06:37.740
<b>Hmm.</b>

06:37.860 --> 06:39.780
<b>You underestimate me.</b>

06:39.990 --> 06:43.240
<b>Yeah. To be blunt,
this is going to be a piece of cake.</b>

06:46.500 --> 06:48.160
<b>I've been through countless battles.</b>

06:49.040 --> 06:53.340
<b>I've sliced up dozens of mutated,
gigantic freaks like you.</b>

06:53.880 --> 06:55.210
<b>I'm used to it by now.</b>

06:59.340 --> 07:01.430
<b>So you're the type
that can split up, huh?</b>

07:01.760 --> 07:04.060
<b>The most annoying kind.</b>

07:04.310 --> 07:06.930
<b>Annoying? You're a fool.</b>

07:07.480 --> 07:08.980
<b>You still think you can win?</b>

07:09.480 --> 07:12.310
<b>I'm a mass of countless versions of me.</b>

07:12.940 --> 07:16.940
<b>No matter how much you cut,
rip, beat, crush, or twist me</b>

07:16.940 --> 07:18.360
<b>I just keep multiplying.</b>

07:20.110 --> 07:21.360
<b>You're the fool.</b>

07:21.740 --> 07:25.580
<b>I'll just unleash countless slashes
on all of you and win.</b>

07:25.950 --> 07:28.250
<b>Do it if you can.
I'll make you weep.</b>

07:28.790 --> 07:30.620
<b>Come on, bring it on.
Let's do this.</b>

07:51.060 --> 07:52.310
<b>Atomic...</b>

07:53.020 --> 07:54.020
<b>Slash!!</b>

07:56.110 --> 07:59.070
<b>It's over. You're dead.</b>

08:01.650 --> 08:02.660
<b><i>What the...?!</i></b>

08:02.780 --> 08:05.830
<b><i>He has this much power</i>
<i>even after splitting up?</i></b>

08:06.780 --> 08:08.120
<b><i>I underestimated him.</i></b>

08:08.370 --> 08:09.830
<b><i>This is bad, there's too many!</i></b>

08:29.810 --> 08:32.230
<b>-So Gyoro-Gyoro had it figured out.
-It's no use.</b>

08:32.350 --> 08:35.480
<b>-Just accept it.
-We're the worst possible match for you.</b>

08:36.150 --> 08:38.070
<b>Heh. I'll bury you.</b>

08:40.780 --> 08:41.860
<b>The ceiling?!</b>

08:45.070 --> 08:46.240
<b>That shaking...</b>

08:48.330 --> 08:49.870
<b>I wonder how the battle is going.</b>

08:49.950 --> 08:51.700
<b>So you're worried?</b>

08:51.830 --> 08:53.790
<b>About how the other heroes
are getting killed?</b>

08:54.170 --> 08:55.000
<b>How did you—?</b>

08:59.500 --> 09:02.010
<b>Maybe they died like this?</b>

09:02.300 --> 09:04.760
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
HOMELESS EMPEROR</b>

09:02.420 --> 09:04.590
<b>Dying instantly without
even being able to resist.</b>

09:05.130 --> 09:08.140
<b>So this is how
a so-called hero dies?</b>

09:08.180 --> 09:09.720
<b>How pathetic.</b>

09:10.720 --> 09:13.520
<b>I checked out the Hero Association's
official website.</b>

09:13.770 --> 09:16.730
<b>The Class-S heroes that are left...</b>

09:17.190 --> 09:20.360
<b>can easily by annihilated by just me!</b>

09:20.400 --> 09:21.230
<b>Wait!</b>

09:39.000 --> 09:40.750
<b>That looks painful.</b>

09:41.170 --> 09:43.010
<b><i>Blocked at that range?!</i></b>

09:45.010 --> 09:48.010
<b><i>Tsk. I was saving this for last...</i></b>

10:00.310 --> 10:03.440
<b>As expected of one of the top heroes.</b>

10:03.570 --> 10:05.900
<b>Even in death, you refuse to fall.</b>

10:06.030 --> 10:08.110
<b>You must have been quite strong.</b>

10:08.910 --> 10:13.040
<b>Yeah. I don't need a suit that
can withstand heavy bombing</b>

10:13.120 --> 10:15.370
<b>armor that can deflect bullets</b>

10:15.450 --> 10:19.080
<b>or an invincible shield that repels
any kind of physical attack.</b>

10:19.710 --> 10:21.670
<b>All I need is a spare change of clothes.</b>

10:22.420 --> 10:25.010
<b>And above all, I'm very particular
about my boxer shorts.</b>

10:25.590 --> 10:28.470
<b>I have no overwhelming power,
no superior physical ability</b>

10:28.550 --> 10:30.970
<b>no devastating weapons.</b>

10:31.050 --> 10:33.510
<b>The only thing I need to win
a battle is...</b>

10:33.810 --> 10:36.640
<b>The resolve to fight completely naked.</b>

10:37.230 --> 10:40.440
<b>And that's why boxer shorts
are non-negotiable for me.</b>

10:40.520 --> 10:41.900
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

10:42.270 --> 10:44.280
<b><i>Seriously though,</i>
<i>this is no laughing matter.</i></b>

10:44.650 --> 10:46.190
<b><i>This monster is too strong.</i></b>

10:47.650 --> 10:48.490
<b>Hey.</b>

10:48.780 --> 10:52.780
<b>I can't figure out that sneaky,
trick-like attack of yours.</b>

10:53.580 --> 10:54.790
<b>What the hell are you?</b>

10:54.950 --> 10:56.660
<b>I'm surprised.</b>

10:56.870 --> 10:59.040
<b>They don't call you Zombieman
for nothing.</b>

10:59.330 --> 11:03.210
<b>Being immortal wasn't just
a figure of speech, huh?</b>

11:03.880 --> 11:07.130
<b>So you want to know
the secret of this light's power?</b>

11:07.970 --> 11:11.970
<b>Fine... I'll tell you how
I acquired this power.</b>

11:12.390 --> 11:16.770
<b>Until a month ago, I stayed at a park,
living day by day.</b>

11:18.180 --> 11:20.730
<b><i>I lost my job and got kicked out</i>
<i>of my home.</i></b>

11:20.850 --> 11:24.940
<b><i>I left human society behind</i>
<i>and lived as a recluse.</i></b>

11:25.270 --> 11:26.860
<b><i>At a welcome party</i>
<i>for new employees</i></b>

11:26.860 --> 11:29.820
<b><i>my boss ordered me</i>
<i>to dance naked.</i></b>

11:30.110 --> 11:33.030
<b><i>The next day,</i>
<i>I was fired for sexual harassment.</i></b>

11:33.990 --> 11:35.910
<b><i>But when I looked up at the sky</i></b>

11:35.950 --> 11:39.120
<b><i>my resentment toward</i>
<i>my boss no longer mattered.</i></b>

11:39.870 --> 11:42.420
<b><i>The Earth is bigger than any building</i></b>

11:42.540 --> 11:44.840
<b><i>and the sky is brighter than</i>
<i>any man-made light.</i></b>

11:45.460 --> 11:48.300
<b><i>Humans are but insignificant beings.</i></b>

11:48.960 --> 11:52.430
<b><i>My home is this vast Earth itself.</i></b>

11:53.140 --> 11:54.930
<b><i>And then it hit me...</i></b>

11:55.720 --> 12:00.180
<b><i>Humans have strayed from</i>
<i>the natural order of Mother Earth</i></b>

12:00.230 --> 12:03.980
<b><i>abandoning it to flourish selfishly</i>
<i>under our own rules.</i></b>

12:04.020 --> 12:06.070
<b><i>The stupidity of humans is staggering.</i></b>

12:07.190 --> 12:08.690
<b>This is outrageous.</b>

12:09.070 --> 12:13.410
<b>To think these ignorant beings
treat me as inferior!</b>

12:14.450 --> 12:15.620
<b>It's unbearable.</b>

12:16.910 --> 12:17.990
<b>Just unbearable.</b>

12:18.870 --> 12:20.250
<b>So unbearable.</b>

12:20.700 --> 12:23.040
<b><i>Humanity, with its shallow intelligence</i></b>

12:23.040 --> 12:25.920
<b><i>built this ugly, tiny,</i>
<i>and foolish world...</i></b>

12:26.090 --> 12:31.420
<b><i>To break free from it and</i>
<i>to truly return to Mother Earth...</i></b>

12:32.800 --> 12:35.050
<b><i>I had no choice</i>
<i>but to choose death.</i></b>

12:36.260 --> 12:37.680
<b><i>And that's when it happened.</i></b>

12:39.470 --> 12:42.560
<b><i>God appeared before my eyes.</i></b>

12:43.940 --> 12:45.400
<b><i>You are correct.</i></b>

12:45.730 --> 12:50.190
<b><i>Humans are fools.</i>
<i>But you do not need to die.</i></b>

12:51.070 --> 12:53.200
<b><i>I shall grant you power.</i></b>

12:53.740 --> 12:56.820
<b><i>You already know what</i>
<i>you must to do with that power.</i></b>

12:58.450 --> 13:02.540
<b>In other words, this was a divine power,
given to me by God.</b>

13:02.830 --> 13:06.670
<b>And of course, I was chosen
because I know the answer.</b>

13:07.710 --> 13:11.210
<b>Humanity and its foolishness
are a harmful existence to this planet.</b>

13:11.460 --> 13:13.420
<b>The time has come for me</b>

13:13.470 --> 13:16.510
<b>to destroy its existence,
its civilization, all of it.</b>

13:17.220 --> 13:22.220
<b><i>Oh crap, his story ended</i>
<i>before I could fully regenerate.</i></b>

13:23.140 --> 13:26.730
<b>So what made you believe
that guy was actually God?</b>

13:27.350 --> 13:28.810
<b>Did it have some kind of ID?</b>

13:29.110 --> 13:31.940
<b>You do not need to believe in God</b>

13:31.980 --> 13:33.530
<b>and I've heard enough
of your nonsense.</b>

13:34.320 --> 13:38.740
<b>Atone for your excessive arrogance
by dying and returning to dust.</b>

13:40.200 --> 13:42.790
<b>Hey, is the ground all right here?</b>

13:43.120 --> 13:45.160
<b>I hope my place isn't falling apart.</b>

13:47.080 --> 13:49.790
<b>Maiko Plasma High Voltage Mode.</b>

13:50.380 --> 13:52.590
<b>Love Lightning Session.</b>

13:54.880 --> 13:56.380
<b>Take that!</b>

13:58.510 --> 13:59.470
<b>Did we beat him?</b>

14:02.140 --> 14:03.600
<b>What's with that pose?!</b>

14:04.220 --> 14:08.020
<b>Whoa... Class A and Class S
are on a different level...</b>

14:08.400 --> 14:10.860
<b>We should have had
the advantage in this matchup...</b>

14:10.980 --> 14:13.610
<b>The special attacks didn't work on him.</b>

14:14.190 --> 14:15.740
<b>What kind of body does he have?</b>

14:16.150 --> 14:17.570
<b>Why so surprised?</b>

14:18.360 --> 14:22.030
<b>I simply embraced the pain with
love deeper than the ocean.</b>

14:22.830 --> 14:25.660
<b>I call it the Angel Hug.</b>

14:25.830 --> 14:28.290
<b>-I don't get it.
-Who the hell is this guy?</b>

14:29.000 --> 14:30.040
<b>We're retreating for now!</b>

14:32.590 --> 14:33.590
<b>Where are you going?</b>

14:34.460 --> 14:37.550
<b>You think Gyoro-Gyoro and Orochi
would approve of you retreating?</b>

14:34.630 --> 14:37.550
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
VACUUMER</b>

14:37.720 --> 14:38.590
<b>Shut up.</b>

14:38.720 --> 14:41.970
<b>Then you fight that freak alone.</b>

14:42.100 --> 14:43.310
<b>-Yeah, do it.
-Yeah, do it.</b>

14:43.430 --> 14:44.850
<b>Okay, will do.</b>

14:45.180 --> 14:48.350
<b>But first, I want your powers.</b>

14:58.320 --> 14:59.780
<b>Monsters killing monsters?</b>

15:02.070 --> 15:05.240
<b>You have no love...for your comrades.</b>

15:06.910 --> 15:08.750
<b>I'm done with the appetizers.</b>

15:09.120 --> 15:11.170
<b>Now for the main dish.</b>

15:14.550 --> 15:16.340
<b>I can use these superpowers</b>

15:16.380 --> 15:19.930
<b>however I want until I digest
and excrete them.</b>

15:20.430 --> 15:25.180
<b>I have more than enough time
to wipe out every last hero.</b>

15:25.350 --> 15:29.020
<b>Defeat them?
Impossible for someone like you.</b>

15:29.390 --> 15:31.060
<b>I'm a Class-S hero</b>

15:31.100 --> 15:34.480
<b>but compared to them,
I'm just an average man.</b>

15:34.940 --> 15:37.820
<b>Hey, Monster.
Before you go running your mouth</b>

15:37.900 --> 15:42.410
<b>let's see if you can take care of
this average adult male in front of you.</b>

15:42.610 --> 15:44.950
<b>What do you mean,
average adult male?</b>

15:45.030 --> 15:46.160
<b>You're a freak of nature!</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:52.330
<b>Looks like your body's
already screaming in pain.</b>

15:52.460 --> 15:53.880
<b>You're trembling...</b>

15:54.000 --> 15:56.590
<b>The electricity and poison
are taking a toll on you.</b>

15:56.710 --> 15:58.260
<b>This was bound to happen.</b>

15:58.550 --> 16:00.470
<b>Embracing the pain?</b>

16:00.800 --> 16:02.510
<b>It's all just tough talk.</b>

16:04.430 --> 16:06.260
<b>Your spirit may be tough</b>

16:06.310 --> 16:08.930
<b>but if your body can't keep up,
then it's pointless.</b>

16:14.810 --> 16:17.020
<b>What did you do?
What was that?</b>

16:18.190 --> 16:23.110
<b>Apparently, my love has given
birth to a new style.</b>

16:24.530 --> 16:27.740
<b>Vibration Angel descended!!</b>

16:29.830 --> 16:30.660
<b>Huh?</b>

16:30.910 --> 16:35.250
<b>Vibration Dark Angel Rush!!</b>

16:39.510 --> 16:42.720
<b>You... You truly are a freak.</b>

16:50.060 --> 16:50.890
<b>Honey!</b>

16:51.350 --> 16:52.230
<b>Let's get outta here.</b>

16:52.600 --> 16:55.270
<b>But what will Gyoro-Gyoro
and Orochi do to us?</b>

16:55.480 --> 16:56.560
<b>Who cares?</b>

16:56.980 --> 17:01.690
<b>My whiskers sense a huge earthquake
or even something bigger coming.</b>

17:02.280 --> 17:06.530
<b>Whoa, even the monsters
think he's a freak.</b>

17:07.030 --> 17:08.080
<b><i>Those voices...</i></b>

17:08.450 --> 17:11.950
<b>We've tried slitting his throat
so many times and failed every time.</b>

17:12.120 --> 17:15.960
<b>Never heard of anyone whose skin
can beat a razor except him.</b>

17:16.130 --> 17:17.960
<b>But today's the day we kill him.</b>

17:18.250 --> 17:19.420
<b>Prepare yourself.</b>

17:19.550 --> 17:20.960
<b>The boss of the stinky prison...</b>

17:21.130 --> 17:25.880
<b>No, our mortal enemy, the Class-S hero,
Puri-Puri Prisoner!</b>

17:26.140 --> 17:28.760
<b>My honeys who were taken away
by the monsters?!</b>

17:28.970 --> 17:30.600
<b>Why do you look like that?</b>

17:30.810 --> 17:32.350
<b>You look like monsters.</b>

17:32.640 --> 17:34.430
<b>Look who's talking!</b>

17:35.140 --> 17:37.310
<b>Damn that Monster Association.</b>

17:37.650 --> 17:40.020
<b>How could they be so cruel
to these helpless boys?</b>

17:40.230 --> 17:41.730
<b>Hang in there.
I'm coming to save you—!</b>

17:43.490 --> 17:44.900
<b>Who're you calling helpless?</b>

17:43.650 --> 17:48.240
<b>BAM POW WHACK</b>

17:45.070 --> 17:46.780
<b>He's so annoying. Get him!</b>

17:46.950 --> 17:48.410
<b>Suffer, you piece of trash!!</b>

17:48.660 --> 17:50.950
<b>Don't think this'll settle the score!</b>

17:51.160 --> 17:52.790
<b>We'll go back to the prison later</b>

17:52.830 --> 17:56.210
<b>and slaughter your friends
and the guards.</b>

17:56.960 --> 18:01.880
<b>Oh my god.
Monsterization has twisted their hearts.</b>

18:02.210 --> 18:03.920
<b>Wake up!</b>

18:05.010 --> 18:07.590
<b>Try to remember those glorious days.</b>

18:08.180 --> 18:09.510
<b>We ate and slept together.</b>

18:10.100 --> 18:12.060
<b>We sweated together doing
the same prison work.</b>

18:12.260 --> 18:14.270
<b>And we all loved each other
so dearly</b>

18:14.390 --> 18:16.600
<b>and were connected heart to heart.</b>

18:16.850 --> 18:18.770
<b>We remember.
That's why we're here for revenge!</b>

18:18.770 --> 18:20.610
<b>You were slacking off
during prison labor.</b>

18:20.610 --> 18:22.860
<b>Why doesn't anything
get through to this guy?</b>

18:22.940 --> 18:24.610
<b>I'll save you, no matter what.</b>

18:24.650 --> 18:25.650
<b>Just trust me.</b>

18:25.690 --> 18:26.990
<b>He's not listening...</b>

18:27.030 --> 18:28.660
<b>Once you turn into a monster</b>

18:28.660 --> 18:30.700
<b>you can never go back
to being a human.</b>

18:31.620 --> 18:32.870
<b>Too bad, huh?</b>

18:33.790 --> 18:36.000
<b>THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
NYAAN</b>

18:34.870 --> 18:35.830
<b><i>So sleepy...</i></b>

18:36.660 --> 18:40.420
<b>My boyfriend's...hand-knit sweater...</b>

18:41.130 --> 18:43.000
<b>Okay... The rest is up to you, guys.</b>

18:43.210 --> 18:45.510
<b>Wow, so that's a top ranker...</b>

18:45.760 --> 18:47.760
<b>All right. This is
our chance to finish him off!</b>

18:51.600 --> 18:53.060
<b>He's still moving.</b>

18:53.560 --> 18:57.230
<b>My honeys will never
be human again?</b>

18:58.140 --> 19:00.480
<b>Heh, you're wrong.</b>

19:01.560 --> 19:05.190
<b>If your heart is human,
that makes you a true human being.</b>

19:05.690 --> 19:06.860
<b>I won't give up.</b>

19:07.240 --> 19:09.990
<b>I'm going to save my boyfriends,
no matter what.</b>

19:10.110 --> 19:11.950
<b>For love, nothing is impossible!!</b>

19:12.160 --> 19:13.780
<b>Man, he's not listening.</b>

19:13.870 --> 19:15.290
<b>And we're not your boyfriends.</b>

19:15.410 --> 19:16.620
<b>Who cares? Kill him!</b>

19:16.750 --> 19:17.870
<b>Kill him!</b>

19:22.130 --> 19:23.590
<b>He feels different?!</b>

19:23.670 --> 19:24.630
<b>What the—?</b>

19:24.920 --> 19:26.710
<b><i>What happened?</i></b>

19:26.920 --> 19:33.900
<b>RUMBLING</b>

19:28.260 --> 19:29.630
<b><i>From all the accumulated damage</i></b>

19:29.630 --> 19:31.510
<b><i>his survival instincts were awakened</i></b>

19:31.890 --> 19:33.970
<b><i>and his body underwent</i>
<i>a rapid evolution...</i></b>

19:34.640 --> 19:35.610
<b><i>Something like that?</i></b>

19:35.850 --> 19:38.060
<b>Have I grown angel wings?</b>

19:38.180 --> 19:39.480
<b>Obviously, it's just body hair.</b>

19:39.600 --> 19:40.560
<b>You're not an angel!</b>

19:40.690 --> 19:41.940
<b>Look how long it is!</b>

19:42.060 --> 19:44.900
<b>I shall call it,
Angel Bristly Armor.</b>

19:45.110 --> 19:46.530
<b>Knock it off with that pose.</b>

19:46.820 --> 19:49.780
<b>Now that I've gained defensive power...</b>

19:50.110 --> 19:54.570
<b>I'll cuddle with my honeys later
and go after that cat first.</b>

19:55.990 --> 19:57.290
<b><i>I can't stand him.</i></b>

19:57.740 --> 19:59.620
<b><i>This feeling reminds me of...</i></b>

20:00.120 --> 20:03.710
<b><i>My former owner forcing</i>
<i>her affection on me.</i></b>

20:04.040 --> 20:05.090
<b>Oh well, whatever.</b>

20:05.290 --> 20:07.550
<b>I'll leave him to the other top rankers.</b>

20:08.670 --> 20:09.760
<b>Through a gap like that?!</b>

20:12.550 --> 20:16.140
<b>Give me three millimeters and
I can slip through any gap.</b>

20:16.810 --> 20:19.810
<b>So I'll go after another hero. Bye!</b>

20:19.850 --> 20:22.640
<b>Hey, Prisoner.
We're gonna kill you...</b>

20:22.690 --> 20:23.690
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

20:24.900 --> 20:26.570
<b>Angel Crawl!</b>

20:26.690 --> 20:28.820
<b>I'll swim underground and chase
that cat monster.</b>

20:30.190 --> 20:31.610
<b>Doesn't make sense.</b>

20:32.150 --> 20:33.030
<b>Meow?!</b>

20:33.240 --> 20:35.030
<b><i>I can sense him approaching.</i></b>

20:35.450 --> 20:37.620
<b><i>I instinctively detest this guy.</i></b>

20:38.330 --> 20:43.210
<b><i>I live a selfish existence.</i>
<i>I only fight who I want.</i></b>

20:43.540 --> 20:45.500
<b>I'll chase you to
the ends of the earth.</b>

20:45.540 --> 20:46.540
<b>He's too much for me!</b>

20:49.050 --> 20:50.630
<b>Oh, you came back, Nyaan?</b>

20:50.920 --> 20:52.510
<b>Did you finish off Prisoner?</b>

21:05.230 --> 21:06.230
<b><i>That cat...</i></b>

21:06.440 --> 21:08.770
<b><i>He said he'll go after other heroes...</i></b>

21:10.230 --> 21:11.650
<b><i>but he doesn't get it.</i></b>

21:12.320 --> 21:13.860
<b><i>I bet he'll regret it.</i></b>

21:14.530 --> 21:16.700
<b>He'll soon realize that
going up against me</b>

21:16.820 --> 21:18.700
<b>would've been the better choice.</b>

21:19.910 --> 21:22.120
<b>They got caught in the crossfire!</b>

21:22.870 --> 21:24.210
<b>My boyfriends!</b>

21:32.710 --> 21:36.510
<b>I'll take this new attack
as a gift from all of you.</b>

21:37.180 --> 21:38.970
<b>Thank you, my honeys.</b>

21:39.890 --> 21:41.970
<b>I won't let your sacrifices be in vain.</b>

21:42.680 --> 21:45.190
<b>Please watch over me in this battle.</b>

21:46.350 --> 21:47.310
<b>Damn you...</b>

21:53.990 --> 21:56.030
<b>So it finally stopped, huh?</b>

21:57.070 --> 22:00.160
<b>What an awful, disgusting sound.</b>

22:01.080 --> 22:04.200
<b>Yet there was something
kind of sad about it.</b>

22:04.540 --> 22:05.830
<b>What the heck was that?</b>

22:07.210 --> 22:09.840
<b>Was it like the gates of hell
opening up or something?</b>

22:11.460 --> 22:14.550
<b>But seriously, what is this place?
It's ridiculously huge.</b>

22:15.420 --> 22:17.800
<b>I shoulda asked
those perverts for directions.</b>

22:19.300 --> 22:20.180
<b>All right.</b>

22:20.510 --> 22:22.810
<b>Next time I spot someone
who looks like they live here</b>

22:22.890 --> 22:24.770
<b>I'll grab them and
make them guide me.</b>

23:56.150 --> 24:00.880
<b>ULTIMATE LIFEFORM</b>
